    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d53-a1">

                <pb facs="0110" n="50" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg50"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Translation of extract respecting treaty with the
                        United States.</hi></head>
                <dateline>[<date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1868-03-21">March 21, 1868</date>]</dateline>
                <p>A treaty which has been concluded with the United States of America is designed
                    to regulate the nationality of immigrants to either country, and thus to remove
                    from the relations between two nations, closely related by commercial interests
                    and family ties, the germ of discord.</p>
            </div>
